# Managed skills ship as read-only store symlinks (see nix/home.nix). Keep this
# tree pure skill CONTENT — never commit installed-project cruft or secrets.
node_modules/
*.env
accounts.json
*.key
*.pem
.git/

# clickup skill state. It normally lives in $XDG_STATE_HOME/clickup (see
# clickup/lib/paths.mjs) — this entry exists so a LEGACY copy, or a stray
# `add-account` run from inside the checkout, can never be staged into a
# PUBLIC repo. .cache/ holds the session JWTs; accounts.json (a live `pk_`
# token) and .env are covered above.
.cache/
